   - bzcat file.txt.bz2     :: View text content strings directly from bz2 zipped environments
   - bzgrep "text" file.bz2 :: Search contents inside bz2 zipped architecture modules
** Zip / Unzip Utility
   - zip file.zip file1 file2       :: Create zip package container
   - zip -r dir.zip folder/        :: Recursively zip comprehensive directory structures
   - unzip file.zip                 :: Extract standard zip architecture contents
   - unzip -l file.zip              :: List directory manifest inside zipped structures
   - zip -r -p secure.zip folder/   :: Generate encryption password protection on target zip file
   - unzip -d /path/ file.zip       :: Extract standard zip file directly to target destination path
** Combined Tar Compression Best Practices
   - tar -czvf archive.tar.gz <dir> :: Create compressed GZIP archive bundle
   - tar -xzvf archive.tar.gz       :: Extract compressed GZIP archive container structure
   - tar -cjvf archive.tar.bz2 <dir>:: Create compressed BZIP2 archive bundle
   - tar -xjvf archive.tar.bz2      :: Extract compressed BZIP2 archive container structure
